  "Learning activities recorded": { ms: "Aktiviti pembelajaran direkodkan", zh: "学习活动已记录" },
  "Edit reflection": { ms: "Sunting refleksi", zh: "编辑反思" },
  "These are your activity notes, not proof that you finished the course. Follow the provider’s own completion requirements.": { ms: "Ini catatan aktiviti anda, bukan bukti penyelesaian kursus. Ikuti syarat penyelesaian penyedia.", zh: "这些是你的活动笔记，不是完成课程的证明。请遵循课程提供方的完成要求。" },
  "Learning check progress": { ms: "Kemajuan semakan pembelajaran", zh: "学习检查进度" },
  "{passed} of {available} available assessments passed": { ms: "{passed} daripada {available} penilaian tersedia telah lulus", zh: "已通过 {passed} 项，共 {available} 项可用测评" },
  "No assessment is available for the courses in this plan yet.": { ms: "Belum ada penilaian untuk kursus dalam pelan ini.", zh: "此计划的课程暂时没有可用测评。" },
  "Only passed app assessments count. External course completion and skill mastery are not verified. Progress clears on refresh.": { ms: "Hanya penilaian aplikasi yang lulus dikira. Penyelesaian kursus luar dan penguasaan kemahiran tidak disahkan. Kemajuan dipadam apabila halaman dimuat semula.", zh: "仅计算通过的应用内测评。外部课程完成情况及技能掌握程度未经验证。刷新页面后进度清除。" },
  "Bookkeeping practice check": { ms: "Semakan latihan simpan kira", zh: "簿记练习检查" },
  "Learn with OpenLearn": { ms: "Belajar dengan OpenLearn", zh: "在 OpenLearn 学习" },
  "Take the practice check": { ms: "Cuba semakan latihan", zh: "开始练习检查" },
  "Pass all 3 questions": { ms: "Jawab ketiga-tiga soalan dengan betul", zh: "答对全部 3 道题" },
  "Three original questions using fictional examples, based on the course learning outcomes. This is a prototype practice check, not an OpenLearn assessment or qualification.": { ms: "Tiga soalan asli menggunakan contoh rekaan berdasarkan hasil pembelajaran kursus. Ini semakan latihan prototaip, bukan penilaian atau kelayakan OpenLearn.", zh: "三道原创题使用虚构案例，依据课程学习目标编写。这是原型练习检查，不是 OpenLearn 测评或资格认证。" },
  "Course learning outcomes": { ms: "Hasil pembelajaran kursus", zh: "课程学习目标" },
  "Start guided learning": { ms: "Mulakan pembelajaran berpandu", zh: "开始引导学习" },
  "Study the accounting equation, double-entry records and trial balances with OpenLearn. Return here to try the practice check.": { ms: "Pelajari persamaan perakaunan, rekod catatan bergu dan imbangan duga di OpenLearn. Kembali ke sini untuk mencuba semakan latihan.", zh: "在 OpenLearn 学习会计等式、复式记账与试算平衡，然后回到这里进行练习检查。" },
  "Answer every question before checking your work.": { ms: "Jawab semua soalan sebelum menyemak jawapan.", zh: "请回答全部题目后再检查答案。" },
  "Check my answers": { ms: "Semak jawapan saya", zh: "检查我的答案" },
  "Not passed yet. Review the explanations and course material, then change your answers and try again. All 3 must be correct.": { ms: "Belum lulus. Semak penerangan dan bahan kursus, kemudian ubah jawapan dan cuba lagi. Ketiga-tiga jawapan mesti betul.", zh: "暂未通过。请阅读解释和课程资料，修改答案后重试。必须答对全部 3 道题。" },
  "Practice check passed · 3 of 3 correct": { ms: "Semakan latihan lulus · 3 daripada 3 betul", zh: "练习检查已通过 · 3 题全对" },
  "You passed this short app check. It does not confirm completion of the OpenLearn course or mastery of the mapped skills.": { ms: "Anda lulus semakan ringkas aplikasi ini. Ini tidak mengesahkan penyelesaian kursus OpenLearn atau penguasaan kemahiran yang dipadankan.", zh: "你通过了这项简短的应用内检查。这不代表已完成 OpenLearn 课程或掌握相关技能。" },
  "No app assessment for this course yet. Course completion is not verified.": { ms: "Belum ada penilaian aplikasi untuk kursus ini. Penyelesaian kursus tidak disahkan.", zh: "此课程暂时没有应用内测评。课程完成情况未经验证。" },
  "A fictional business has assets of 8,000 and liabilities of 3,000. What is its capital?": { ms: "Sebuah perniagaan rekaan mempunyai aset 8,000 dan liabiliti 3,000. Berapakah modalnya?", zh: "一家虚构企业有资产 8,000、负债 3,000。其资本是多少？" },
  "Assets = capital + liabilities, so capital = 8,000 − 3,000 = 5,000.": { ms: "Aset = modal + liabiliti, maka modal = 8,000 − 3,000 = 5,000.", zh: "资产 = 资本 + 负债，因此资本 = 8,000 − 3,000 = 5,000。" },
  "The owner puts 2,000 cash into a fictional business. Which entry records it?": { ms: "Pemilik memasukkan tunai 2,000 ke dalam perniagaan rekaan. Catatan manakah yang betul?", zh: "业主向一家虚构企业投入现金 2,000。应如何记账？" },
  "Debit capital; credit cash": { ms: "Debit modal; kredit tunai", zh: "借记资本；贷记现金" },
  "Debit cash; credit capital": { ms: "Debit tunai; kredit modal", zh: "借记现金；贷记资本" },
  "Debit cash; credit sales": { ms: "Debit tunai; kredit jualan", zh: "借记现金；贷记销售收入" },
  "Cash, an asset, increases with a debit. The owner’s capital increases with a credit; this is not sales income.": { ms: "Tunai ialah aset dan bertambah melalui debit. Modal pemilik bertambah melalui kredit; ini bukan hasil jualan.", zh: "现金是资产，增加记在借方；业主资本增加记在贷方。这不是销售收入。" },
  "A trial balance has total debits of 4,500 and total credits of 4,200. What should you do?": { ms: "Imbangan duga menunjukkan jumlah debit 4,500 dan kredit 4,200. Apakah tindakan anda?", zh: "试算平衡表的借方合计为 4,500，贷方合计为 4,200。你应怎么做？" },
  "Add 300 to sales to make it balance": { ms: "Tambah 300 pada jualan supaya seimbang", zh: "给销售收入加上 300 使其平衡" },
  "Treat the difference as profit": { ms: "Anggap perbezaan sebagai untung", zh: "将差额视为利润" },
  "Investigate the 300 difference in the records": { ms: "Siasat perbezaan 300 dalam rekod", zh: "调查账目中 300 的差额" },
  "Investigate the difference rather than invent an entry. Equal totals alone would still not prove every transaction was recorded correctly.": { ms: "Siasat perbezaan, jangan mereka catatan. Jumlah yang sama juga tidak membuktikan setiap urus niaga direkodkan dengan betul.", zh: "应调查差额，不能编造分录。即使两边合计相等，也不能证明每笔交易都记录正确。" },
  'My course status': { ms: 'Status kursus saya', zh: '我的课程状态' },
  'Not started': { ms: 'Belum bermula', zh: '尚未开始' },
  'In progress': { ms: 'Sedang dipelajari', zh: '学习中' },
  'Completed': { ms: 'Selesai', zh: '已完成' },
